{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13385","headline":"释奠武成王乐章 送神 · 于邵","name":"释奠武成王乐章 送神","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明祀方终，备乐斯阕。\n黝纁就瘗，豆笾告撤。\n肸蠁尚余，光景云灭。\n返归虚极，神心则悦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于邵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13385.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13385","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}